&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bec381d94068323490075a1457f5f6d6, https://si.imgix.net/f9c56030/uploads/origins/5a7c6e7c-e7d7-491c-9fda-b5194c707f2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8886ec1a41c99a87821f11d9d99a1a7f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f9c56030/uploads/origins/5a7c6e7c-e7d7-491c-9fda-b5194c707f2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6003b55cdd1ca63d54645b300e83cc1b 3x"}, "body": "If you don't mind, I would like to ask you to illustrate two people, a man and a woman!\n\nMale】・Height: 170cm-ish, boy to young man.\nHeight: 170cm-ish, boy to young man, white eyes, normal build, rebellious personality.\nGirl\n Large girl, over 200cm tall ・Breasts are large ・With so-called \"mine\" type fashion and make-up\n\nI would like to see a relationship where the big girl is in love with the boy and the boy is rebellious but blushes at the girl's pressure. Hair color, clothes, poses, etc. are up to you.\n I would appreciate your consideration. Thank you in advance.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@pomichi02/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2652982, "client_id": 1543266, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/735de72b/uploads/origins/e1165774-5229-46a0-92c3-65b93a38e656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aacd4ca610d967e48894907f20c283aa", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/735de72b/uploads/origins/e1165774-5229-46a0-92c3-65b93a38e656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aacd4ca610d967e48894907f20c283aa, https://si.imgix.net/735de72b/uploads/origins/e1165774-5229-46a0-92c3-65b93a38e656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fd7577927551dc4e98da24115e97eb1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/735de72b/uploads/origins/e1165774-5229-46a0-92c3-65b93a38e656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4cc4ffe85fc79b0ea5924860db894907 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/735de72b/uploads/origins/e1165774-5229-46a0-92c3-65b93a38e656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=40d91b6e64cf812c345bdc8b3e19ef98", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/735de72b/uploads/origins/e1165774-5229-46a0-92c3-65b93a38e656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=40d91b6e64cf812c345bdc8b3e19ef98, https://si.imgix.net/735de72b/uploads/origins/e1165774-5229-46a0-92c3-65b93a38e656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6317cdda82e6ff1c1035e09460f1ad61 2x, https://si.imgix.net/735de72b/uploads/origins/e1165774-5229-46a0-92c3-65b93a38e656?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f225e08b5cb11712de96cf8403f7eb3 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for your appeal!\nWe are very honored that you took the time to look over our creation!\n\nWe would love to have you draw Kaito and Seito.\nI have already set up their appearance to some extent, but you are free to arrange their clothes in a way that makes it easier to draw.\n\nKaido.\nHe has dark blue hair and blue eyes. His expression is hard and the light in his eyes is subdued.\nThe feather-like parts on her head are part of her hair.\nHis physique looks average, but he works out hard.\nHe has a strong sense of responsibility and is very disciplined.\n\nSeito.\nHe has peach-colored hair with a light blue gradation at the ends and pale blue eyes.\nHe has not eaten well, so he is slender and has a body shape that is difficult to distinguish between men and women.\nHe has a modest personality, but he is willing to work for harmony and leadership.\n\nHis team is a logistics support team, mainly supplying supplies and support.\nHideto, Shakuto, and Hideto are cheerful and friendly,\nMametou is timid and runs away,\nLing Dou is moody, but he wants to get the job done quickly, so he will concentrate on it.\nI would like to ask for your help if you have extra power within the range of the amount.\n\nI am attaching the documents for your review.\nI look forward to working with you.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/jv06k03mo0yfuhk2mfots/ABbUS_ZXwvH8UnqImEa-6EM?rlkey=hhrmpdagu070thergsg953fok&st=j88wm4d6&dl=0", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1032884, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "wat1/2", "screen_name": "nojimanonojiko", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2Fwebpublic-c7129370-187c-43be-889c-4c6929f8f497.png%3Fsensitive%3Dtrue&avatar=1", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 100, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 1411921, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "𝕊𝕀ℝ𝕌", "screen_name": "srymak4", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1612063588344270850/VksbZar9.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1378018708648456195/1672168607/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 1741279, "creator": true, "nsfw_accep